  "title": "A subject is the phenomenal side of a system in a state",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "6e212715-2984-41f5-b325-3d9db7e2d2a2",
      "text": "Following Whitehead's prehension, a subject is the phenomenal side of a system in a certain state. Its life span is the interval between the event that prepares it and the event it produces in another system.",
